$.Mo.R(0,A.ax([$.kM[1],A.aJh("Back","Proceed","Friday","Monday","Saturday","Sunday","Thursday","Tuesday","Wednesday","The Neptun servers are working as hard as an average Hungarian construction worker...","We are waiting until the CEO of SDA informatics drowns in coffee...","Be patient, the servers are down because a rat got into them...","I'm more likely to believe there are penguins at the North Pole than SDA informatics has spent money on Neptun servers...","Neptun servers are so reliable, I would do my banking on them...","SDA meaning: Sok Dagadt Analfab\xe9ta, aka: Many Fat Analfabetics. They couldn't create a usable mobile app...","I would bet my house that you are still reading this because it is still loading...","Your phone would go up in flames if this was faster...","Still better than the non-existent Neptun mobile app...","Loads in any millennium now...","There's a power outage at SDA informatics...","SDA informatics is an amazing company...",'Did you know? "Neptun 2" was created in about 1 week...',"Too slow? Send a complaint to SDA informatics...","Just a second...","We are getting there...","Easy does it...","It's really loading something...","So, found it?...","Hold up! It can't do it that fast...","Forgot what you just read? Try taking B6 vitamins!...","april","august",k,"february","january","july","june","march","may",l,"october","september","No Data","Import","Click on the button, then select your freshly downloaded timetable file!","Bad ICS file! \ud83d\ude35","Calendar use","Dont know where you can find your neptun timetable (.ics file)?",'Go to "My data" > "Settings" > "Calendar export"\nIf you want accurate data, select exporting from september 1. (xxxx.09.01), to the next years september 1. (xxxx.09.01)! \ud83e\udd13',"\ud83e\udd73Free Day!\ud83e\udd73","This week is empty! \ud83e\udd73","Classes this week: %0 %1. - %2 %3.","Thinking... \ud83e\udd14","Class this week: %0 %1. (%2)","Jump to current week","%0. education week","Copied! \ud83d\udccb","Can't find your school in the list?","Items in the list above were added manually! \ud83d\ude05 It is possible that some institutes are missing from it.\nYou can log in via URL if you can't find your school. \ud83d\ude09","Loading...","No network...","Search","Nothing found...","Select institute","Select a valid institute! \ud83d\ude21","\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8/\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7","If you have multi-factor authentication enabled on your account, you won't be able to log in!","\u274c Neptun2 uses the old Neptun mobile app API, which didn't include multi-factor authentication. If your account is protected by it, you won't be able to log in via Neptun2.\n\n\ud83e\udd13 But you can turn it off, and you will be able to use Neptun2 without a problem.\nTo turn it off, go to \"My Data/Settings\" in Neptun web.","ERROR! Please go back!","Provide valid credentials! \ud83d\ude21","Invalid username or password!","Login","Log in","Logging in...","Neptun servers are having a hard time...","Neptun code","Password","Average: %0 %1","Scholarship index: %0 %1","Completed","\ud83e\udd2aYou don't have any subjects\ud83e\udd2a","You have no grades","All messages marked as read! \u2709\ufe0f","\ud83d\ude25You don't have any messages\ud83d\ude25","Mark all as read","Sent by: %0","\ud83d\ude07All paid\ud83d\ude07","%0Huf",d,"(%0 days since deadline)",d,"\ud83e\udd29Break time\ud83e\udd29","Expired: ","(%0 days ago)","(in %0 days)","Starts: ","\ud83d\udc7b Ghost grade \ud83d\udc7b","Select grade...","\u2699 Settings \u2699","Downloading language","Can't download, no internet","%0 - Installed from: ","Package Installer","Google Play","Outspoken loading texts","If you turn this on, loading texts will become outspoken.","Exam notifications","Exam notifications will send you notifications 2 weeks beforehand. It is useful if you like procrastinating studying, or tend to forget.","Notifications before classes","It will send you notifications 10 minutes, 5 minutes, and at the start of the class, so you won't miss them. Useful if you want to know what class you are going to have beforehand, without needing to check your phone (ex: You have a smartwatch)","Payment notifications","If you have payments due, the app will notify you every day, until they are paid. Useful if you tend to forget, or just don't want to miss a due date.","Period notifications","If a new period is about to become active, the app will notify you 1 day before the given period, and the day they become active. Useful if you don't want to miss something important tied to periods (ex: class registration period).","App haptics","You can set if you want the app to give you haptic feedback (vibrate).","Study week offset","Auto","If you have issues with the current study week, you can offset it to the correct week!","App language","Select what language the app shall speak to you.","App theme","Select how the app should look like","Downloading theme","\u2b50 Rate The App! \u2b50","Do you like the app? Do you hate it? Rate it on Google Play!\nIt takes about 10 seconds, and it gives me and other users feedback.","Rate it","\ud83d\udc8c Message \ud83d\udc8c","Subject code:","Location:","\ud83d\udce2 Subject Info \ud83d\udce2","Subject start time:","Taught by:","\u26a0\ufe0f Exam Info \u26a0\ufe0f","Exam start time:","\ud83e\udd37 There is an issue with your account \ud83e\udd37","It seems like we can't fetch data from your Neptun.\nPlease log out, and log back in.","Logout","Update","\ud83e\udef5 Old App Version \ud83e\udef5","This version of the app is outdated.\nPlease consider updating the app for the best user experience! \ud83d\ude0c","\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f App Language \ud83d\udde3\ufe0f","The app supports the language you are speaking.\nChange it if you want to.","Change","Ok","Missing Data...","Is there a problem with the app?\nTell me! \ud83d\udc49","Calendar Use","You can load your timetable, if it was a calendar, but if the university makes a change with it, you will not have the latest one.\nYou should only use this, if you can not login into the app!","Institute selection","This is the simplest way. It is a list where you can search for your university, however, not all institutes can be found here!","Offline modes","Select login method",m,"If you can't find your university in the list, you can enter the Neptun URL of your school to log in. This might not work with all universities!","Good afternoon! \ud83e\udd42","Good evening! \ud83c\udf7b","Merry midnight! \ud83c\udf7c","Good night! \ud83c\udf79","Good morning! \u2615","Good day! \ud83c\udf77","You have %0 unread messages \ud83d\udc8c","You have spent %0Huf on university \ud83d\udcb8","Active","Expired","Future",i,"Your credits this semester: %0\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f","Account balance","Hello %0! \ud83d\udc4b","You are logged in here: \ud83d\udd17\n%0",f,"No new messages",e,"Semester","Semester switched: %0","%0 new messages","\ud83d\udc1e Bug report","\ud83d\udeaa Log out","You have logged out successfully! \ud83d\udeaa","\u2699 Settings","\ud83c\udf81 Support developer","Institute Neptun URL","This is not a valid Neptun URL! \ud83d\ude21\n\nPaste something similar here:\nhttps://neptun-ws01.uni-pannon.hu/hallgato/login.aspx \ud83e\udd2b","Enter a valid Neptun URL! \ud83d\ude21","Login via URL","Where do I find the URL?","Go to your school's Neptun website, and paste the link from up top. \ud83d\udd17\n\nEx: https://neptun-ws01.uni-pannon.hu/hallgato/login.aspx","Calendar",f,e,"Periods","Subjects")],p,o))
